  <article class="pr-card" id="p-4-3-4ก" data-pkey="pTB-4-3-4ก">
    <div class="pr-head"><span class="pr-num">แบบฝึกหัด 4.3 ข้อ 4 (ก)</span><span class="tag exam">🎯 แนว ⑥</span><span class="diff">●●○</span><span class="spacer"></span>
