        <li><span class="step-t">Δ₁, Δ₂</span> \(\Delta_1 = 3 \gt 0\) ✓; \(\Delta_2 = \det\begin{bmatrix} 3 & 0\\ 0 & 1 \end{bmatrix} = 3 \gt 0\) ✓</li>
        <li><span class="step-t">Δ₃ = det A</span> เปิดตามแถวแรก: \(3(2-k^2) - 0 + 1(0-1) = 5 - 3k^2\) → บวกแน่นอน ⟺ \(k^2 \lt \frac{5}{3}\) → \(-\sqrt{\frac{5}{3}} \lt k \lt \sqrt{\frac{5}{3}}\) (ประมาณ ±1.29)</li>
